1. all-MiniLM-L6-v2 sentence-embedding model
   ios/RelateBooks/Embedding/Model/ (MiniLM_L6_v2.mlmodelc, vocab.txt)
   Converted to Core ML from sentence-transformers/all-MiniLM-L6-v2
